x + 0  =>  x
1 * (x + 0)  =>  x
2 + 3 * 4  =>  14
(y - y) * z + w * 1  =>  w
a + b + (a + b)  =>  2 * (a + b)
2 * (3 * x)  =>  6 * x
d/dx (x)  =  1
d/dx (y)  =  0
d/dx (x + 3)  =  1
d/dx (x * y)  =  y
d/dx (3 * pow(x, 2) + 2 * x)  =  6 * x + 2
d/dx (pow(x + 1, 3))  =  3 * pow(x + 1, 2)
d/dx (y * pow(x, 4))  =  y * (4 * pow(x, 3))
